/* File:        03-streamreader.rxj
 * Description: This application opens a file and reads from it using different techniques
 * Shows:
 *              - Using a linefeed and pretty print routine
 *              - Difference between ReadToEnd, ReadLine and Read
 *              - Using the class "System.Convert" to convert a number representing a char into a real char
 *
 *  license:
 *
 *  ------------------------ Apache Version 2.0 license -------------------------
